---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  showHeader={false}
  showFooter={false}
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="fun-container">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        All video content and thumbnails created and published on my <a href="https://glomble.com/profiles/Dani" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Glomble</a> profile are released under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Creative Commons Zero</a> into the public domain.
      </p>
      <p>
        This applies strictly to video files &amp; thumbnails. It does not apply to profile pictures, banners, written comments, or any other non-video content shared on/by my profile, all of which remain under standard copyright protection.
      </p>
      <p>
        As a result, you are completely free to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Cut, remix, color-grade, re-voice, or alter any video file or thumbnail in any way you like.</li>
        <li>Feature the media in films, documentaries, social media posts, software, live streams, or websites.</li>
        <li>Include the footage in monetized videos, client projects, paid products, or marketing campaigns without paying royalties or fees.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You do not need to ask for permission, tag me, or provide attribution, although it is always appreciated.
      </p>
      <p>
        Please note that while this dedication waives my copyright to video footage and thumbnails, it does not cover third-party trademarks, copyrighted content made by others, or individual model/likeness rights for recognizable people in the videos. Please double-check rights clearance for those elements before using the footage.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .fun-container {
    margin: auto 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
</style>

